{"seq":3,"slug":"multi-node-promise-optimize","title":"多仓多承运选路求最早/最低成本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/delivery-promise-engine/atp-ctp-compute/multi-node-promise-optimize","wordCount":2897,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"多仓多承运选路求最早-最低成本\">多仓多承运选路求最早/最低成本</h1><p>单一发货方案的情况下，CTP 只算一次。但跨境卖家通常在多个海外仓有货、每个仓能走的承运商不止一家、每个承运商还有多个服务等级。可选组合是<strong>仓 × 承运商 × 服务等级</strong>的笛卡尔积，几十到上百种组合并不罕见。逐一算 CTP 再排序，在购前链路的延迟预算里是不可行的。</p>\n<p>这一篇讲怎么把这个问题化简成可实现的规模，以及怎么在「最早到达」与「最低成本」两个目标之间做出确定的取舍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-这是一个带约束的最短路问题\">核心概念：这是一个带约束的最短路问题</h2><p>把每个候选发货方案看成一个「边」，它有三个属性：<strong>可行性</strong>（该仓在该承诺窗内有 ATP）、<strong>到达时间</strong>（由 CTP 推算得出）、<strong>成本</strong>（仓内作业成本 + 干线运费 + 尾程派送费）。目标是在可行的边集合中选一条，使得：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>时效优先</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>arrive</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min \\; t_{\\text{arrive}}(e)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">arrive</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，约束为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>feasible</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{feasible}(e)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">feasible</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，同分时取成本较低者。</li>\n<li><strong>成本优先</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min \\; c(e)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，约束为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>arrive</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>max</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{arrive}}(e) \\le D_{\\text{max}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">arrive</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">max</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，即承诺日底线。</li>\n<li><strong>加权</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>t</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min \\; \\alpha \\cdot \\hat{t}(e) + \\beta \\cdot \\hat{c}(e)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1285em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8785em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1841em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>t</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8785em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8785em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1841em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{c}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是归一化后的值。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三种口径对应不同的业务场景。大促期间通常用成本优先（时效底线由运营给定）；日常流量用时效优先（转化敏感）；而加权形式看起来最灵活，实际上最难维护——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha/\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 会随季节、品类、目的国漂移，需要持续校准。<strong>推荐做法是只实现前两种，把加权需求表达成「先按时效底线剪枝、再按时效排序取前 K、最后在 K 个里按成本选」</strong>，这样两个参数都有明确业务含义（底线是承诺日，K 是成本优化空间）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    O[&quot;订单:SKU + 目的地 + 服务等级&quot;] --&gt; E[&quot;枚举候选&lt;br/&gt;仓 × 承运商 × 等级&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F1[&quot;剪枝①:ATP 可行性&lt;br/&gt;该仓该窗口有量?&quot;]&#10;    F1 --&gt; F2[&quot;剪枝②:线路可达&lt;br/&gt;目的国/邮编可达?&quot;]&#10;    F2 --&gt; F3[&quot;剪枝③:成本上限&lt;br/&gt;报价 ≤ 阈值?&quot;]&#10;    F3 --&gt; R[&quot;对剩余组合算 CTP&lt;br/&gt;(可并行)&quot;]&#10;    R --&gt; S1[&quot;时效优先:取最早&quot;]&#10;    R --&gt; S2[&quot;成本优先:取底线内最低成本&quot;]&#10;    S1 --&gt; OUT[&quot;选定方案 + 承诺日 + 成本&quot;]&#10;    S2 --&gt; OUT\">graph TD\n    O[\"订单:SKU + 目的地 + 服务等级\"] --&gt; E[\"枚举候选&lt;br/&gt;仓 × 承运商 × 等级\"]\n    E --&gt; F1[\"剪枝①:ATP 可行性&lt;br/&gt;该仓该窗口有量?\"]\n    F1 --&gt; F2[\"剪枝②:线路可达&lt;br/&gt;目的国/邮编可达?\"]\n    F2 --&gt; F3[\"剪枝③:成本上限&lt;br/&gt;报价 ≤ 阈值?\"]\n    F3 --&gt; R[\"对剩余组合算 CTP&lt;br/&gt;(可并行)\"]\n    R --&gt; S1[\"时效优先:取最早\"]\n    R --&gt; S2[\"成本优先:取底线内最低成本\"]\n    S1 --&gt; OUT[\"选定方案 + 承诺日 + 成本\"]\n    S2 --&gt; OUT</pre><p>三层剪枝的顺序是刻意的：<strong>先剪可行性（廉价判断）、再剪可达性（查表）、最后剪成本（需要报价）</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>剪枝层</th>\n<th>判断依据</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n<th>单次代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ATP 可行性</td>\n<td>该仓该窗口的桶内 ATP ≥ 订单量</td>\n<td>进程内 ATP 快照</td>\n<td>极低（内存查表）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线路可达性</td>\n<td><code>(carrier, country, postal_prefix)</code> 是否覆盖</td>\n<td>路由表（周级更新）</td>\n<td>低（索引查表）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本上限</td>\n<td>报价是否低于该线路的动态阈值</td>\n<td>报价缓存（日级更新）</td>\n<td>中（需计费重与分区）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>按代价升序剪枝，能把需要算 CTP 的组合从上百降到个位数；反过来先算成本会让绝大部分候选在完成昂贵的报价查询后才发现根本不可行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"剪枝策略\">剪枝策略</h2><h3 id=\"atp-可行性剪枝\">ATP 可行性剪枝</h3><p>只有当某仓在目标承诺窗内有可用 ATP 时，该仓才是候选。这一步与 <a href=\"available-to-promise\">可承诺量（ATP）计算</a> 中的时间桶结构直接对应：给定一个期望承诺日 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>，只需检查「覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 的桶」的 ATP 是否大于订单量。</p>\n<p>注意这里存在一个循环依赖：<strong>ATP 桶的边界依赖 CTP 的结果，而 CTP 的候选依赖 ATP 的可用性</strong>。工程上的解法是解耦——用「仓 × 目的区域」的<strong>粗略承诺日范围</strong>（例如「该仓到美国西部大约 5-9 个工作日」）来定义 ATP 的时间桶边界，而不是用精确的 CTP 结果。粗粒度带来的误差（可能少算或多算一两个桶）由 ATP 侧的安全余量吸收。这个解耦让 ATP 可以离线预计算，不必在请求路径上实时算。</p>\n<h3 id=\"线路可达性剪枝\">线路可达性剪枝</h3><p>跨境场景下可达性不是一个布尔值，它有多个层次：目的国是否在承运商的覆盖范围内、该邮编是否属于偏远地区（可能附加派送时间或不可达）、商品是否属于禁运品类（电池、液体、仿牌）。这一层应该做成一张按 <code>(carrier, country, postal_prefix)</code> 索引的路由表：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE lane_coverage (&#10;  carrier_code     VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL,&#10;  service_level    VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL,&#10;  origin_node      VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL,&#10;  country_code     CHAR(2)     NOT NULL,&#10;  postal_prefix    VARCHAR(8)  NOT NULL,&#10;  reachable        TINYINT(1)  NOT NULL,&#10;  remote_area      TINYINT(1)  NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  extra_days       TINYINT     NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  restrictions     JSON        NULL,&#10;  effective_from   DATE        NOT NULL,&#10;  effective_to     DATE        NULL,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (carrier_code, service_level, origin_node, country_code, postal_prefix, effective_from),&#10;  KEY idx_lookup (country_code, postal_prefix, reachable)&#10;) ENGINE=InnoDB;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> lane_coverage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  carrier_code     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  service_level    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  origin_node      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  country_code     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  postal_prefix    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reachable        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TINYINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  remote_area      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TINYINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  extra_days       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TINYINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  restrictions     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JSON</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_from   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_to     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (carrier_code, service_level, origin_node, country_code, postal_prefix, effective_from),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> idx_lookup (country_code, postal_prefix, reachable)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) ENGINE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">InnoDB;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>extra_days</code> 是这张表的关键字段：偏远地区不是「不可达」，而是「多 N 天」。把它表达成一个可加到在途时长上的增量，比把它表达成可行/不可行的二元判断更贴近现实——很多生意恰恰靠偏远地区的订单。<code>restrictions</code> 字段承载品类禁运规则，按 JSON 存储便于扩展，但<strong>不要把它当查询条件</strong>（JSON 字段上的范围查询性能很差），应当把常用规则物化成独立列或独立表。</p>\n<h3 id=\"成本剪枝\">成本剪枝</h3><p>成本剪枝需要一个报价来源。跨境运费报价通常是计费重（volumetric weight）与目的地分区的函数，典型形式是分区费率表（zone rate card）。本 hub 只消费报价数据，并强调一点：<strong>成本剪枝的阈值必须是动态的，不能写死</strong>。一个固定阈值（例如「只考虑 50 元以内的方案」）会在旺季（运价普涨）时把全部候选剪光，在淡季时形同虚设。正确做法是按 <code>(线路, 周次)</code> 维护一个成本分位阈值（例如取该线路近 4 周成本分布的 P75），随市场漂移。</p>\n<h2 id=\"求解与排序\">求解与排序</h2><h3 id=\"剩余组合的并行计算\">剩余组合的并行计算</h3><p>剪枝后剩余的组合通常不超过 10 个，此时可以并行计算 CTP。并行方式有两种：进程内的异步批处理（适合组合数少、计算是纯内存操作的场景），或按仓分片并行（适合仓的时长模型分布在不同的缓存分区上的场景）。</p>\n<p>排序的实现细节比算法本身更容易出错，有三个陷阱：</p>\n<h3 id=\"陷阱一-按自然日排序跨时区出错-承诺日是纯日期-见-仓库-承运商工作日与节假日日历-1_promise-data-calendar-1_warehouse-carrier-calendar-md-两个方案算出不同的承诺日时-比较的是-日期-而不是-时刻-但如果实现中把承诺日转成了时间戳再比较-跨时区的转换会让同一个日期得到不同排序-排序必须直接在纯日期语义上做\">陷阱一：按自然日排序跨时区出错 承诺日是纯日期（见 <a href=\"../promise-data-calendar/warehouse-carrier-calendar\">仓库/承运商工作日与节假日日历</a>），两个方案算出不同的承诺日时，比较的是「日期」而不是「时刻」。但如果实现中把承诺日转成了时间戳再比较，跨时区的转换会让同一个日期得到不同排序。排序必须直接在纯日期语义上做。</h3><h3 id=\"陷阱二-同分时放大成本差异\">陷阱二：同分时放大成本差异</h3><p>两个方案承诺日相同是常见的（在途时长以工作日计量时，多个组合常落在同一天）。此时若随机或按枚举顺序取第一个，可能选到成本高一倍的方案。必须显式定义 tie-breaker：<strong>承诺日相同时取成本最低者</strong>，成本也相同时取稳定性更高的方案（例如历史达标率更高的承运商）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"陷阱三-拆单带来的组合爆炸\">陷阱三：拆单带来的组合爆炸</h3><p>如果允许一个订单从多个仓分拆发货，问题从「选一条边」变成「选一组边的划分」，复杂度从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 上升到指数级。规模较小（行数 ≤ 3-4）时，可以用「按最慢行定承诺」的近似策略：让每一行各自选最优方案，整体承诺日取所有行的最大值。这个近似在多数情况下接近最优，且复杂度是线性的。是否需要真正的划分优化，取决于拆单的收益是否显著——见 <a href=\"../promise-presentation/promise-scenario-split-shipment\">拆单/合单/缺货场景承诺</a>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type Candidate = {&#10;  warehouseId: number;&#10;  carrierCode: string;&#10;  serviceLevel: string;&#10;  promiseDate: string;&#10;  costCent: number;&#10;  onTimeRate: number;&#10;};&#10;&#10;function selectPlan(candidates: Candidate[], mode: &#39;earliest&#39; | &#39;cheapest&#39;, deadline: string): Candidate | null {&#10;  if (candidates.length === 0) return null;&#10;  const viable = mode === &#39;cheapest&#39; ? candidates.filter((c) =&gt; c.promiseDate &lt;= deadline) : candidates;&#10;  const pool = viable.length &gt; 0 ? viable : candidates;&#10;  return pool.reduce((best, cur) =&gt; {&#10;    if (mode === &#39;earliest&#39;) {&#10;      if (cur.promiseDate !== best.promiseDate) {&#10;        return cur.promiseDate &lt; best.promiseDate ? cur : best;&#10;      }&#10;      return cur.costCent &lt; best.costCent ? cur : best;&#10;    }&#10;    if (cur.costCent !== best.costCent) {&#10;      return cur.costCent &lt; best.costCent ? cur : best;&#10;    }&#10;    return cur.onTimeRate &gt; best.onTimeRate ? cur : best;&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Candidate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  warehouseId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  carrierCode</span><span